{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nusing ll      =         long long;\nusing ldbl    =       long double;\nusing ratio_t =       pair<ll,ll>;\nusing ratios  = multiset<ratio_t>;\n\nll b, c, g, n, q, r, t, u, x, y, z; map<ldbl,ratios> result;\n\nint main()\n{\n    ios_base::sync_with_stdio(false), cin.tie(nullptr), cout.tie(nullptr);\n\n    cin >> x >> y >> n, g = gcd(x,y), x /= g, y /= g, q = x/y, r = x%y;\n\n    const auto save_ratio = [](ll a)\n    {\n        g = gcd(a,b), result[ldbl(abs(u-a*z))/t].emplace(b/g,a/g);\n    };\n\n    for (b = 1; b <= n; ++b)\n    {\n        g = gcd(y,b), c = b/g, z = y/g, t = b*z, u = q*t+r*c, save_ratio(u/z);\n\n        if (u%z)\n            save_ratio((u+z-1)/z);\n    }\n\n    auto p = result.cbegin()->second.cbegin();\n\n    cout << p->second << '/' << p->first;\n}\n\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static long b, c, g, n, q, r, t, u, x, y, z;\n    static TreeMap<Double, ArrayList<Pair>> result = new TreeMap<>();\n    \n    static class Pair implements Comparable<Pair> {\n        long first, second;\n        Pair(long f, long s) { first = f; second = s; }\n        public int compareTo(Pair other) {\n            if (first != other.first) return Long.compare(first, other.first);\n            return Long.compare(second, other.second);\n        }\n    }\n    \n    static long gcd(long a, long b) {\n        while (b != 0) {\n            long temp = a % b;\n            a = b;\n            b = temp;\n        }\n        return a;\n    }\n    \n    static void saveRatio(long a, long bVal, long uVal, long zVal, long tVal) {\n        g = gcd(a, bVal);\n        double key = (double) Math.abs(uVal - a * zVal) / tVal;\n        ArrayList<Pair> list = result.computeIfAbsent(key, k -> new ArrayList<>());\n        list.add(new Pair(bVal / g, a / g));\n    }\n    \n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        x = sc.nextLong();\n        y = sc.nextLong();\n        n = sc.nextLong();\n        g = gcd(x, y);\n        x /= g;\n        y /= g;\n        q = x / y;\n        r = x % y;\n        \n        for (b = 1; b <= n; ++b) {\n            g = gcd(y, b);\n            c = b / g;\n            z = y / g;\n            t = b * z;\n            u = q * t + r * c;\n            saveRatio(u / z, b, u, z, t);\n            if (u % z != 0) {\n                saveRatio((u + z - 1) / z, b, u, z, t);\n            }\n        }\n        \n        Map.Entry<Double, ArrayList<Pair>> firstEntry = result.firstEntry();\n        ArrayList<Pair> list = firstEntry.getValue();\n        Collections.sort(list);\n        Pair p = list.get(0);\n        System.out.println(p.second + \"/\" + p.first);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.9\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.006045034155249596, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -4.184158387943171e-05, -2.4318398573086597e-05, -3.4570634852570947e-06, -0.00051